WEBVTT

00:02:55.639 --> 00:03:00.343
Crucially, the people of that time
had to arrange to pay themselves

00:03:00.377 --> 00:03:03.847
to do the things necessary
to heal the biosphere.

00:03:04.381 --> 00:03:07.350
Money had to go to good work
rather than bad.

00:03:07.384 --> 00:03:08.785
This was the crux.

00:03:08.819 --> 00:03:10.020
With that change enacted,

00:03:10.053 --> 00:03:13.023
there was all manner of good work
ready to be performed.

00:03:13.857 --> 00:03:15.959
It has to be understood
that before the 20s,

00:03:15.992 --> 00:03:18.428
capital always went to
the highest rate of return.

00:03:18.462 --> 00:03:19.996
That was the law of capital,

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.865
often literally the law.

00:03:22.265 --> 00:03:24.134
Restoring damage done to the biosphere,

00:03:24.167 --> 00:03:26.570
taking carbon dioxide back out
of the atmosphere --

00:03:26.603 --> 00:03:28.839
these did not yield
the highest rate of return,

00:03:28.872 --> 00:03:30.607
so money went elsewhere,